        "text": "Reference class/base rate: for this seasonally adjusted level series, I use recent official first-print Canada EI levels as the base rate, not the catalog forecast. The January-April sequence was 554.83, 542.11, 548.00, and 544.44 thousand; persistence from the latest official print is therefore a mid-540s baseline."
